  "content": "<h1>Kaleidoscope Cookery 森罗物语：厨房</h1><p>&gt; 一款为Minecraft添加沉浸式烹饪系统与美味食谱的模组，助你开启美食冒险之旅。</p><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-Java版-brightgreen\" alt=\"Minecraft\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge | NeoForge-1.20.1 | 1.21.1-orange\" alt=\"Forge\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/许可证-BSD | CC BY--NC--SA 4.0-blue\" alt=\"License\"></p><h2>简介</h2><p>本模组专为Minecraft Java版开发，致力于为游戏带来丰富的烹饪体验与全新内容。</p><h2>特色</h2><ul>\n<li>🍳 全新烹饪系统</li>\n<li>🥘 丰富美食配方</li>\n<li>🔥 创新烹饪设备</li>\n<li>🎮 沉浸式游戏体验</li>\n</ul><h2>展示</h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1257/986/5ae6ae67-e2c4-468b-b101-9d469d3da9ab-png.png\" alt=\"图片\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1257/987/7f2786df-734e-47aa-9996-02a20c1d2e69-png.png\" alt=\"图片\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1257/988/14c5d260-7ec2-4766-ae8f-6c00188a7d24-png.png\" alt=\"图片\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1257/989/ce2a393a-d1a3-4b08-a13c-86842d87cd30-png.png\" alt=\"图片\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1257/990/ddfccb67-9b6a-47e3-94d5-349bb0a31d2e-png.png\" alt=\"图片\"></p><h2>许可协议</h2><p>本项目采用双重许可协议：</p><ul>\n<li><strong>源代码</strong>：<a href=\"https://github.com/KaleidoscopeMods/KaleidoscopeCookery/blob/main/LICENSE-CODE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSD 3-Clause License</a></li>\n<li><strong>资源文件</strong>：<a href=\"https://github.com/KaleidoscopeMods/KaleidoscopeCookery/blob/main/LICENSE-ASSETS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a></li>\n</ul><h2>反馈与建议</h2><p>若在使用过程中遇到问题或有改进建议，请通过以下方式联系我们：</p><ul>\n<li>🐛 <a href=\"https://github.com/KaleidoscopeMods/KaleidoscopeCookery/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题反馈</a> - 提交漏洞报告</li>\n<li>💡 <a href=\"https://github.com/KaleidoscopeMods/KaleidoscopeCookery/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">功能建议</a> - 提议新功能或讨论交流</li>\n</ul><h2>开发团队</h2><p><strong>Kaleidoscope官方制作组</strong></p><hr><p>*感谢所有为本项目做出贡献的开发者与玩家！*</p>